Xool voice sidecar (xool_voice)

Adapted from "Jarvis Stimme" (jarvis_stimme) of github.com/Paulito12209/jarvis-on-nod,
by the same author as Xool OS: voice activity detection (vad.py), microphone and
speaker streams (audio.py), speech to text (stt.py), text to speech (tts.py),
bridge phrases (bruecken.py), text cleanup (text.py). The thinking, tools and
conversation memory moved into the app's agents; this process only listens and speaks.

It installs, at setup time and not as part of this repository, programs and models with their own
licences: Piper TTS (GPL-3.0), the voice "Thorsten" by Thorsten Müller (CC0),
mlx-whisper and Whisper (MIT, OpenAI), faster-whisper (MIT), Silero VAD (MIT),
sounddevice (MIT), numpy (BSD). See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md at the top of the repository.
